{{Quote|If I cannot rule the cosmos, then I will be the one to destroy it!|Eon to [[Professor Paradox|Paradox]].<ref name="BA"/>}}
'''Eon''' is an interdimensional timeline traveler and one of [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]'s adversaries. He is the archenemy of [[Professor Paradox]], as well as an alternate and evil version of Ben.{{Refn|group = note|name = origin}}

==Appearance==
In '''''[[Ben 10: Race Against Time|Race Against Time]]''''', Eon had pale white skin and maroon marks around his eyes. Eon wore a black bodysuit with a matching trench coat over it, black gauntlets with purple highlights on them, and a black helmet with a purple-tinted visor. The visor was black when he first appeared, but was colorless throughout the rest of the movie.

In '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', Eon wore a silver helmet with a purple visor that blocked all view of his face, leaving only two glowing purple eyes visible. He retained the black bodysuit, but had silver boots, gauntlets, and a chestplate instead; a purple cape to replace his coat. Unmasked, Eon was identical to [[Ben 10,000 (Ultimate Alien)|Ben 10,000]], as he is another adult version of Ben.

In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', Eon retains the black helmet with its purple visor, but his face is visible through it, much like in '''''Race Against Time'''''. Eon's face also now looks radically different to [[Ben 10,000 (Original)|Ben 10,000]]'s, appearing highly aged or just repulsive; his face is long and frail, with a wide mouth, greyish skin, dark lines under his eyes, and thin, black lips. He retains the left arm silver gauntlet and boots, but there are also silver shoulder pads on his black trench coat. He wears a black and purple bodysuit and a silver collar that covers his entire neck.

