Eon possesses chronokinesis, which gives him control over time itself; granted by the purple energy that his body emits. Eon channels the energy through his hands, from which he can influence the entire flow of time around him—allowing him to slow down time for everyone except himself and whomever he's fighting—or focus on a specific person, slowing and reversing their individual time or unnaturally aging them to a mummy-like state.{{Refn|[[:File:Constantine the Mummy.png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="RAT" /> He can use this energy to hatch and age [[Time Beast|Time Beasts]].<ref name="LDtTWA" /> He can also project that same energy from his hands as time rays that instantly age their targets by hundreds of years, turning objects into dust and aging people to near-death.{{Refn|[[:File:Eon Energy Blasts.png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="RAT" /><ref name="B10KR" /><ref name="LDtTWA" />

If Eon's time rays are used on an Omnitrix/Ultimatrix transformation, they will be instantly aged to dust and deleted from the device's active playlist.<ref name="B10KR" />

Eon can channel his energy into circular portals or pillars of energy, capable of transporting himself across time,<ref name="BA" /> [[Multiverse|alternate timelines]],<ref name="B10KR" /><ref name="ATTWN" /> and other dimensions.<ref name="ATTWB">''[[And Then There Was Ben]]''</ref> He can even travel to the [[End of Time|end of a timeline]].<ref name="BA" /><ref name="LDtTWA" /> Eon can also transport others through time, even if he himself is not present with them.<ref name="LDtTWA" /> He can also cross over time warps connecting different time zones without issue, even though they are normally dangerous for organic beings.<ref name="BA" /> 

Eon can use his portals to store and retrieve items<ref name="ATTWN" /> or to summon his robot minions.<ref name="LDtTWA" />

Eon possesses intimate knowledge of Ben and the Omnitrix, as he once had his own Omnitrix{{Refn|[[:File:Eon's Omnitrix.png]]|name = OM|group = DJW}} and has been hunting different versions of Ben for years.<ref name="B10KR" /> His understanding of the Omnitrix is so in-depth, he could easily override a failsafe that prevents the Omnitrix's DNA samples from taking over Ben's consciousness. This makes him a formidable opponent for Ben and any alternate version of him, as he is already aware of their capabilities, sometimes before they even meet him for the first time.<ref name="RAT" /><ref name="ATTWB" />

By touching the Omnitrices of Ben Tennyson at two different points in the same timeline, Eon was able to transfer the younger Ben's consciousness into the older Ben's body, and vice versa.<ref name="BA" /> 

Because Eon is an alternate version of Ben, he can sense a Sotobro effect in time whenever a [[Chronosapien]] uses their own time powers.<ref name="Paradox" /><ref name="ATTWB" />

Eon possesses dynakinesis, allowing him to control energy.{{Refn|[[:File:Chronian Powers.png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="RAT" /> Using his power over energy, Eon can create force fields to trap his opponents, make energy balls that cause things to explode,<ref name="RAT" /> generate shields from his hands,<ref name="BA" /> and produce energy waves.<ref name="RAT" /><ref name="B10KR" /><ref name="BA" /> Eon can also use energy to manipulate and control technology, such as clockwork gears, vehicles, and even the Omnitrix. When he takes control of vehicles, he is somehow able to see out of them remotely.{{Refn|[[:File:Eon Control Cars.png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="RAT" />

Eon possesses materiokinesis, allowing him to manipulate matter.{{Refn|[[:File:Chronian Powers.png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="RAT" /> He can distort the molecules around his form to create illusions. This enabled Eon to fake his death by making it appear that he was burned up by [[Heatblast (Classic)|Heatblast]]. Eon's powers over matter also allowed him to retain his personality in his DNA sample collected in the Omnitrix, which repressed Ben's personality when he transformed into a younger version of Eon.{{Refn|[[:File:Eon Retain Personality.png]]|group = pop-up}}{{Refn|[[:File:Eon Repress Ben's Personality.png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="RAT" /> 

Eon can use telekinesis to throw people around without touching them.<ref name="RAT" />

Presumably due to his powers over time, Eon is immune to the rapid aging effects of Time Beasts.<ref name="LDtTWA" />  

Eon possesses enhanced strength, shown when he was able to tackle and pin Vilgax onto the ground.<ref name="ATTWB" />

Eon is durable enough to withstand [[Diamondhead (Classic)|Diamondhead]]'s projectile shards and [[Big Chuck]]'s explosive energy, and endure [[Wildmutt]]'s tackle.<ref name="RAT" /><ref name="LDtTWA" />

Eon is resistant to fire, as he was able to withstand Heatblast's attacks.<ref name="RAT" /><ref name="B10KR" />

Eon can feed on the power of alternate versions of Ben and make them his slaves. By absorbing enough Bens, he may even have the power to replace a timeline with a new one.<ref name="B10KR" />

