</gallery>
Eon's time rays are useless against anything diamond-related, such as [[Petrosapien (Classic)|Petrosapiens]], since they take millions or even billions of years to age.<ref>[[Ben 10,000 (Ultimate Alien)|'''Ultimate Alien''' Ben 10,000]]</ref><ref name="B10KR" /><ref name="RAT" /><ref name="ATTWB" /> Manna constructs are also immune to his time rays.<ref name="B10KR" />

Eon's time rays can be countered by a [[Chronosapien|Chronosapien's]] abilities, as demonstrated by [[Ultimate Ben]].<ref name="B10KR" />

Eon can be trapped in a specific timeline by [[Professor Paradox]], preventing him from accessing any alternate reality without using the [[Chrononavigator]]. However, he can still freely travel through time in the timeline he is trapped in.<ref name="BA" /> 

Eon cannot travel to points in time where the fabric of spacetime is spread dangerously thin. One such instance was the moment Eon severed Paradox's right arm; if he traveled to that point from the future, the presence of the time travelers alongside a temporally consciousness-inverted Ben could cause a rupture, leaving Eon lost outside of time.<ref name="BA" />

